					"documentation": "# Query Sales Flow of events\n\n## Basic Flow\n\n1. *User/Ez Erregistratua* **text** bat sartu.\n2. *Sistemak* uneko *Sales*(**text**, **description**, **publicationDate**)-ak erakusti non **text** title-en agertzen den.  \n3. *User/Ez Erregistratua**-k xehetasun gehiago ikusi nahi baditu, *Sale* extends **Show Sale**.\n\n## Alternative flow\n1. Ez daude **Sale**-ak **title**-en **text**-a dutenak, **Sistema**-k mezua jakinarazi.\n",
